      "type" : "text",
      "text" : "Summary"
    } ]
  }, {
    "id" : "ad562973",
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "content" : [ {
      "type" : "text",
      "text" : "Builds the office.booking package. It adds the Equipment enum, the Room entity and the Booking entity with its requested/confirmed/cancelled lifecycle, all from the spec's shipped descriptors and forms. A BookingValidator enforces the time-window, capacity, status-transition and confirmed-overlap rules. Each bean gets an observer sheet, and the Rooms and Bookings screens are built from the spec mocks and registered under Meeting rooms. The work is five tasks: Room, Rooms screen, Booking, rules and Bookings screen."
    } ]
  }, {
    "id" : "feature-design-h",
    "type" : "heading",
    "props" : {
      "level" : 2
    },
    "content" : [ {
      "type" : "text",
      "text" : "Design"
