      "type" : "text",
      "text" : ", which gates every Booking save. It checks the time window (same day, 08:00–20:00, end after start), attendees against the Room's capacity, and the status transitions (confirmed only from requested). When a Booking becomes confirmed, or a confirmed one changes room, start or end, it checks for overlap against other confirmed Bookings of the same Room, excluding itself. The overlap test is strict, so touching windows are accepted. A refusal leaves the stored row unchanged, and the check and the write are serialised per Room. It must not touch the screens."
